.TH KINTSUGI-SETUP 1 "2026-10-22" "kintsugi 0.8.0" "Kintsugi Manual"
.SH NAME
kintsugi-setup \- install persona pack and global config
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kintsugi setup
[\-\-model <ref>]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Install the persona pack and global AGENTS.md/config.
.SH OPTIONS
.IP \fB\-\-model\fR
Default model reference
.SH EXAMPLES
Run setup:
.PP
  $ kintsugi setup
.PP
Set default model:
.PP
  $ kintsugi setup --model ollama/llama3
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kintsugi (1),
.BR kintsugi-connect (1)
